{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Dragon Odyssey",
    "steam_appid": 3402270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a grand adventure in a land steeped in legend and magic. Join forces with other players to reclaim your rightful place among the heroes of old!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience top-tier AAA gaming right at your fingertips. Dive into a world of dragons and legends with just a tap. Whether you play for minutes or hours, The Dragon Odyssey offers an unforgettable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or team up with friends to defeat colossal foes! Battle swarms of enemies or engage in epic player-vs-player clashes to prove your valor! Explore a vast and enchanting world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR DESTINY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ultimate hero and embark on an epic journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize your look, equipment, and combat style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Choose from five unique classes \u2013 Warrior, Mage, Gunner, Assassin, and Priest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Select from six different races \u2013 Human, Ogre, Elf, Dwarf, Fairy and Succubus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 RPG-style character creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock new abilities with every victorious battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Upgrade your weapons and armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Seek out hidden treasures and legendary items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Craft your own legendary gear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/c503db58c6cc8c26f31932ef62742ba2.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/c503db58c6cc8c26f31932ef62742ba2.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/c503db58c6cc8c26f31932ef62742ba2.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC, FAST-PACED RPG COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Console-quality graphics and gameplay in the palm of your hand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intuitive controls put you at the heart of the action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Always feel in control, whether battling in dungeons or exploring the wilderness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple directional controls for easy hero movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unleash powerful attacks with a single tap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cross-platform play lets you continue your adventure on PC or mobile</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 ARPG hack-and-slash excitement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dungeon-crawling action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/58ee2dcd89308a9ea3df5f3d7fd2185e.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/58ee2dcd89308a9ea3df5f3d7fd2185e.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/58ee2dcd89308a9ea3df5f3d7fd2185e.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A MAGICAL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and mysterious world awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Journey through diverse landscapes like the ancient city and the mystical Forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Encounter evolving challenges and changing environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immerse yourself in a rich storyline filled with quests, bosses, and adventures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Engage in raids within massive, ever-changing dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Frequent updates ensure there's always something new to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A fantasy RPG adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/6b20dfe2bd1573091411e84f59380556.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/6b20dfe2bd1573091411e84f59380556.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/6b20dfe2bd1573091411e84f59380556.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A MASSIVELY MULTIPLAYER EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless opportunities to connect and collaborate with fellow adventurers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Friends who quest together, stay together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 MMORPG-style gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Team up for dungeon raids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Compete against other players to prove your strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Trade gear to help each other advance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/69e00fcd5fbda6be66a6e6266110083c.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/69e00fcd5fbda6be66a6e6266110083c.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/69e00fcd5fbda6be66a6e6266110083c.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter your playstyle, The Dragon Odyssey delivers a rich ARPG and MMORPG experience. Download now and begin your legendary adventure!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a grand adventure in a land steeped in legend and magic. Join forces with other players to reclaim your rightful place among the heroes of old!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience top-tier AAA gaming right at your fingertips. Dive into a world of dragons and legends with just a tap. Whether you play for minutes or hours, The Dragon Odyssey offers an unforgettable adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or team up with friends to defeat colossal foes! Battle swarms of enemies or engage in epic player-vs-player clashes to prove your valor! Explore a vast and enchanting world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR DESTINY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your ultimate hero and embark on an epic journey</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Customize your look, equipment, and combat style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Choose from five unique classes \u2013 Warrior, Mage, Gunner, Assassin, and Priest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Select from six different races \u2013 Human, Ogre, Elf, Dwarf, Fairy and Succubus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 RPG-style character creation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unlock new abilities with every victorious battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Upgrade your weapons and armor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Seek out hidden treasures and legendary items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Craft your own legendary gear</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/c503db58c6cc8c26f31932ef62742ba2.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/c503db58c6cc8c26f31932ef62742ba2.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/c503db58c6cc8c26f31932ef62742ba2.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC, FAST-PACED RPG COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Console-quality graphics and gameplay in the palm of your hand</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intuitive controls put you at the heart of the action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Always feel in control, whether battling in dungeons or exploring the wilderness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Simple directional controls for easy hero movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Unleash powerful attacks with a single tap</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cross-platform play lets you continue your adventure on PC or mobile</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 ARPG hack-and-slash excitement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dungeon-crawling action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/58ee2dcd89308a9ea3df5f3d7fd2185e.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/58ee2dcd89308a9ea3df5f3d7fd2185e.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/58ee2dcd89308a9ea3df5f3d7fd2185e.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A MAGICAL WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast and mysterious world awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Journey through diverse landscapes like the ancient city and the mystical Forest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Encounter evolving challenges and changing environments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Immerse yourself in a rich storyline filled with quests, bosses, and adventures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Engage in raids within massive, ever-changing dungeons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Frequent updates ensure there's always something new to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A fantasy RPG adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/6b20dfe2bd1573091411e84f59380556.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/6b20dfe2bd1573091411e84f59380556.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/6b20dfe2bd1573091411e84f59380556.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A MASSIVELY MULTIPLAYER EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless opportunities to connect and collaborate with fellow adventurers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Friends who quest together, stay together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 MMORPG-style gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Team up for dungeon raids</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Compete against other players to prove your strength</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Trade gear to help each other advance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/69e00fcd5fbda6be66a6e6266110083c.poster.avif?t=1740736864\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/69e00fcd5fbda6be66a6e6266110083c.webm?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3402270/extras/69e00fcd5fbda6be66a6e6266110083c.mp4?t=1740736864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter your playstyle, The Dragon Odyssey delivers a rich ARPG and MMORPG experience. Download now and begin your legendary adventure!</p>",
